            "repere": "Paragraphe · We know you have tried everything, and…",
            "text": "We know you have tried everything, and everyone claims they can help you. But nothing works. Maybe you've tried <span style=\"font-weight:600\">benzo, doxy, Rx, OTC creams, retinols, antibiotics and Azelaic Acid. </span> Combine that with exhausting diet changes and hefty sheet changing, and it's no wonder you are sick of it. Sick of all the lies from companies that claim they can help you...<br><br>Norse is unlike anything you have ever seen or felt. Look at the products. Pure plant extract and arctic beeswax mixed together purely to take care of acne-prone skin once and for all. <span style=\"font-weight:600\">No cheap fillers or BS.</span> Look at our reviews. No brands have reviews like us. We have <span style=\"font-weight:600\">helped 758,162+ REAL people.<br><br></span>I know you still have your doubts, even considering all of this. You have been lied to SO many times. That's why we offer the <span style=\"font-weight:600\">100% money back guarantee</span> on top of all this. Just send us an email if you're not happy and we will refund you immediately. Now it's up to you to take the leap of faith, and maybe you will send us a DM like hundreds before you in a couple of weeks: <span style=\"font-weight:600\">\"I can't believe I didn't start sooner\"</span>. Please take a before-and-after photo. Nothing makes us happier than seeing another set of before-and-afters.",
